{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dicey Tales</strong> is a <strong>deck-building roguelike RPG inspired by board games</strong>.<br>Roll the dice to attack enemies and predict their moves.<br>Recruit allies as you progress and shape your own adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice + Tactics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\uc774\ub3d9_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Battles take place on a <strong>7\u00d77 grid</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use dice to move your heroes and attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ud50c\ub808\uc5b4_\uc2a4\ud0ac_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine dice values to unleash powerful skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc11c\ub85c\uacf5\uaca9_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, a crisis can turn into an opportunity\u2014use enemy attacks strategically to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>18 Unique Heroes &amp; Skill Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ub3d9\ub8cc_\ubaa8\uc9d1_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit and develop <strong>18 unique heroes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc601.png?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero follows a different skill path and plays a unique role in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leverage their distinctive abilities to make every battle dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more heroes you gather, the stronger their synergy becomes\u2014push enemies back, burn them, or freeze them in place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World &amp; Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ub178\ub4dc_\uc624\ud508_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey filled with countless stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From heroes to townsfolk, and even a mischievous little imp\u2014everyone has a tale to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ubc1c\ub77c_\ud569\ub958_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover their stories, recruit them, and expand your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc2ac\ub77c\uc784_\uc774\ubca4\ud2b8_\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\ub3c4\uc804_\uc601_1.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice and shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc5ec\uc2e0\uc0c1_\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out Goddess Statues to receive blessings and enhance your dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc5ec\uc2e0\uc0c1_\uc720\ubb3c_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relics with unique effects help define your combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect relics to maximize your heroes\u2019 potential and discover new ways to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heroic Chronicle</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc5f0\ub300\uae30_\uc601.png?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience as you play and strengthen the Heroic Chronicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Empower your team and unlock new starting heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rampage in the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/1c8d729e84ee3f19c7a147c47eeceb8bc2cba320.jpg"},{"name":"Horror of the Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/5178b711ccf88c1c0951bc6bea927ad755e31aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Origin of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/0ab954e20e5e470f30079d7e2e2f1d1ae2892d5f.jpg"},{"name":"The First Possibility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/ad1a96f995e92926b0b4390bfde3a5b34049f59a.jpg"},{"name":"Last Ally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image