wn adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice + Tactics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\uc774\ub3d9_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Battles take place on a <strong>7\u00d77 grid</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use dice to move your heroes and attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ud50c\ub808\uc5b4_\uc2a4\ud0ac_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine dice values to unleash powerful skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc11c\ub85c\uacf5\uaca9_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, a crisis can turn into an opportunity\u2014use enemy attacks strategically to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>18 Unique Heroes &amp; Skill Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ub3d9\ub8cc_\ubaa8\uc9d1_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit and develop <strong>18 unique heroes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc601.png?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero follows a different skill path and plays a unique role in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leverage their distinctive abilities to make every battle dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more heroes you gather, the stronger their synergy becomes\u2014push enemies back, burn them, or freeze them in place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World &amp; Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ub178\ub4dc_\uc624\ud508_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey filled with countless stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From heroes to townsfolk, and even a mischievous little imp\u2014everyone has a tale to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\ubc1c\ub77c_\ud569\ub958_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover their stories, recruit them, and expand your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc2ac\ub77c\uc784_\uc774\ubca4\ud2b8_\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\ub3c4\uc804_\uc601_1.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice and shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/\uc5ec\uc2e0\uc0c1_\uc8fc\uc0ac\uc704_\uc601.gif?t=1741691513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out Goddess Statues to receive blessings and enhance your dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=